// builtin cast package declaration
//
// Exposes the cast conversion module to all Kuzo user code as visible by default (builtin is fully visible by default).
// Raw: @extern("C") type cast primitives (widen/narrow/special)
// Cast: Kuzo wrapper (two-step relay combining primitives)
// cast(x).to(T) is desugared at the parser layer into a __cast_to<T>(x) normal function call,
// after sema infers the source type S it resolves to __cast_S_to_T(x).
pub pack Raw
pub pack Cast
